url: https://www.emeco.net/products/chairs#collections=broom-by-philippe-starck

Collaboration between [[Phillippe Starck]] and [[Emeco]]. 

The idea was, what if we just swept up all the waste in the factory and compressed it into a chair!?

This is on the spectrum of [[Waste = Food]] design solutions.